.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
*.log
docs/logs/netact_runs/

# Thu muc STAGING TAM tren may dev de gom wheel truoc khi mang sang server.
# KHONG dua vao git vi:
#   - Server production offline lay package tu
#     /home/auto/Python_Project/Package/python_packages/ CHU KHONG tu repo
#     (server offline) - wheel nam trong repo khong phuc vu duong deploy nao.
#   - ~20 MB binary vao git se nang repo VINH VIEN: git giu nguyen moi blob
#     trong history, xoa file o commit sau KHONG lam nho lai, phai viet lai
#     history (rewrite) moi go duoc.
# DEPLOY: khi them dependency moi, copy tay wheel sang thu muc package cua
# server - xem muc DEPLOY trong docs/DEV_LOG.md.
wheels/

# Bundle deploy dong goi TAM de mang sang server (adapters_bundle.tar.gz,
# deploy_bundle.tar.gz...) - KHONG PHAI MA NGUON, chi la ban nen cua chinh cac
# file da co trong repo.
# CUNG LY DO voi wheels/ o tren: binary vao git la nang repo VINH VIEN - git
# giu nguyen moi blob trong history, xoa file o commit sau KHONG lam repo nho
# lai, phai viet lai history (rewrite) moi go duoc.
# Truoc khi co dong nay, 2 file bundle nam untracked va `git add -A` se nuot
# ca vao commit ma khong ai de y.
*.tar.gz

# Tile OSM tai ve cho ban do offline (scripts/download_osm_tiles.py).
# ~89.000 file PNG / 1.3 GB - la DU LIEU TAI VE, khong phai ma nguon: chay lai
# script la co lai. CUNG LY DO voi wheels/ va *.tar.gz o tren - binary vao git
# la nang repo VINH VIEN.
# Tile khong di theo git: nen lai, mang tay sang .197, dat o /home/auto/osm-tiles/
# Dung osm_tiles*/ (co dau *) chu KHONG chi osm_tiles/: script nhan --output tuy
# y nen thuc te hay de ra thu muc thu nghiem canh ben (osm_tiles_thu/,
# osm_tiles_z14/...). Chi chan dung 1 ten thi cac thu muc do lot luoi.
# Dau / cuoi: chi chan THU MUC, khong dinh nham file ten osm_tiles*.
osm_tiles*/

# File nen tile de mang sang server (osm_tiles_YYYYMMDD.tar).
# CUNG LY DO voi osm_tiles*/ o tren: 538 MB binary, la DU LIEU TAI VE
# khong phai ma nguon. Mau osm_tiles*/ co dau / cuoi nen chi chan THU MUC,
# file .tar lot qua -> phai them mau rieng.
osm_tiles*.tar
osm_tiles*.tar.gz

# File VERSION do scripts/make_version.* sinh ra luc BUILD (commit hash, thoi
# diem build, co dirty hay khong). KHONG vao git vi:
#   - Noi dung KHAC NHAU moi lan build tren moi may -> commit vao se thanh
#     nguon xung dot merge vinh vien, va tu no lam working tree ban (dirty=true)
#     ngay sau khi sinh -> lan build ke tiep ghi dirty=true oan.
#   - Gia tri cua no la MO TA ban da deploy, khong phai ma nguon: tren may dev
#     lay tu `git log` la du, chi SERVER (khong co .git) moi can file nay.
# File di theo BUNDLE deploy, khong di theo git. Xem docs/DEPLOY.md.
VERSION

# File export HO neighbor THAT tu NetAct (adapters/netact/data_test/) -
# vd R012-Neighbor_HO_Analysis-<user>-...csv, ~3 trieu dong/~500MB, dung de
# chay thu scripts/kiem_tra_thuat_toan_ho.py tren may dev. KHONG vao git:
#   - Nang hang tram MB -> phinh to repo vinh vien, kho push/clone.
#   - La DU LIEU HA TANG MANG THAT (ten eNB/cell/toa do thuc), khong phai
#     fixture test nho da duoc chon loc (khac data_crr012_hni_*.csv da co
#     san trong cung thu muc - file do NHO va la fixture, van giu trong git).
adapters/netact/data_test/R012-Neighbor_HO_Analysis-*.csv

# Cau hinh NetAct (NETACT_SERVERS_FILE, 23/10/2026) - CHUA MAT KHAU tung NA.
# KHONG BAO GIO vao git; tren .196 dat o /home/auto/secrets/ (chmod 600).
# Chi file mau *.example.json (password rong) duoc commit.
*netact_servers*.json
!netact_servers.example.json
